      "description": "Scheduler-reserved CPU from pod requests. Fleet real capacity ≈ 9.8k cores (26 nodes, net of cocoon VMs).",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
